WEBVTT

00:00:13.700 --> 00:00:16.320
The enemy awaits at Honnoji!

00:00:17.520 --> 00:00:19.680
My lord, it's an insurrection.

00:00:20.400 --> 00:00:22.350
Outside, it's troops as far 
as the eye can see.

00:00:23.050 --> 00:00:25.380
There's not even room enough for 
an ant to slip through.

00:00:25.960 --> 00:00:27.790
And what crest does 
the enemy bear?

00:00:28.050 --> 00:00:29.000
It's...

00:00:29.980 --> 00:00:31.720
...the Chinese bellflower, sir.

00:00:37.770 --> 00:00:38.900
Wait here.

00:00:39.190 --> 00:00:40.250
But, my lord!

00:00:40.510 --> 00:00:44.040
It can't be helped. 
You've gone and done it now!

00:00:54.280 --> 00:00:55.800
Mitsuhide!

00:01:17.100 --> 00:01:19.490
I'll be taking your life now.

00:01:20.430 --> 00:01:22.840
Oda Nobunaga...

00:01:26.940 --> 00:01:28.480
<b>Inny</b>

00:01:27.690 --> 00:01:29.270
<b>Bedhead</b>

00:01:31.020 --> 00:01:32.770
<b>Mirror</b>

00:01:31.190 --> 00:01:33.280
<b> Booty</b>

00:01:31.810 --> 00:01:34.220
No facial hair? No little mustache 
or anything?!

00:01:37.820 --> 00:01:38.950
<b> Plastic model (fighter jet)</b>

00:01:37.990 --> 00:01:41.200
Phew, it was just a dream!

00:01:39.110 --> 00:01:40.030
<b>Replica (gun)</b>

00:01:40.200 --> 00:01:41.120
<b>Plastic model (tank)</b>

00:01:41.960 --> 00:01:45.010
But why was I some old dude?

00:01:58.300 --> 00:01:59.430
<b>Meeting time: 8:00</b>

00:02:00.050 --> 00:02:02.390
<b>A girl who sleeps in</b>

00:02:03.770 --> 00:02:06.840
I'm gonna be late! 
Jeez, Mom, wake me up!

00:02:06.840 --> 00:02:08.760
But you never get up!

00:02:08.760 --> 00:02:09.640
I do, too!

00:02:09.640 --> 00:02:10.680
You're not forgetting anything?

00:02:10.680 --> 00:02:12.280
No, I'm not!

00:02:12.280 --> 00:02:13.470
I'm off!

00:02:13.470 --> 00:02:15.210
Have a good trip!

00:02:15.650 --> 00:02:17.030
<b>White bread</b>

00:02:15.990 --> 00:02:17.030
Man...

00:02:18.800 --> 00:02:20.500
Gotta hurry!

00:02:21.850 --> 00:02:24.140
Seriously, though, what was 
with that dream?!

00:02:39.300 --> 00:02:44.050
<b>Gun No. 1: Oda Nobunaga</b>

00:02:42.250 --> 00:02:43.910
Okay, we're all here.

00:02:44.640 --> 00:02:46.260
Everyone board in order!

00:02:46.260 --> 00:02:47.400
Okay!

00:02:47.400 --> 00:02:50.330
S-Sorry!

00:02:51.770 --> 00:02:53.480
<b>Bedhead</b>

00:02:56.010 --> 00:02:58.580
I'm so... sorry I'm late...

00:02:59.880 --> 00:03:01.970
And... you are...

00:03:01.320 --> 00:03:03.700
<b>Asao Kaoru
Ogura Sio
Kawasumi Aya</b>

00:03:01.970 --> 00:03:04.070
Ah! Ogura Sio?

00:03:05.830 --> 00:03:08.720
Oh, you're late! 
Hurry up and board.

00:03:06.240 --> 00:03:08.000
<b>He'd forgotten her.</b>

00:03:12.060 --> 00:03:13.110
Right.

00:03:16.640 --> 00:03:18.840
All right! Reel her in!

00:03:18.840 --> 00:03:19.540
Aye!

00:03:20.300 --> 00:03:22.040
Pretty calm out, huh?

00:03:22.040 --> 00:03:24.560
Days like this, we can 
make a huge haul.

00:03:24.560 --> 00:03:26.120
That'd be great.

00:03:28.980 --> 00:03:30.180
What the...?

00:03:42.100 --> 00:03:43.980
Satellite D is sending a 
preliminary alert.

00:03:44.210 --> 00:03:48.400
We're reading a potential target off the
 coast of Taiwan, near the Bashi Channel.

00:03:48.880 --> 00:03:50.570
Heading west at 25 knots!

00:03:50.940 --> 00:03:52.540
Level three alert!

00:03:52.540 --> 00:03:54.380
Holders, stand by for 
combat orders.

00:03:55.180 --> 00:03:59.840
The uninvited always knock 
unexpectedly...

00:04:00.440 --> 00:04:01.910
Projecting the theater map!

00:04:08.470 --> 00:04:10.140
<b>Drool</b>

00:04:11.350 --> 00:04:12.930
<b>A girl who drools</b>

00:04:11.630 --> 00:04:14.010
This is gonna be so fun! 
What should we get to eat?

00:04:14.010 --> 00:04:16.130
Whoa! You can see Taiwan!

00:04:38.940 --> 00:04:42.000
J-Just here for sightseeing!

00:04:49.080 --> 00:04:50.210
Ogura!

00:04:50.280 --> 00:04:51.690
Y-Yessir!

00:04:51.820 --> 00:04:54.890
Got it? Everybody stay 
with the group.

00:04:54.890 --> 00:04:56.270
Okay!

00:05:00.620 --> 00:05:02.140
Say "cheese"!

00:05:13.110 --> 00:05:14.630
Wowzers!

00:05:19.700 --> 00:05:21.080
Let's see what's over there!

00:05:21.080 --> 00:05:22.610
Oh, that looks cool.

00:05:22.610 --> 00:05:23.900
What's up, Kaoru?

00:05:23.900 --> 00:05:25.270
Ah, sorry!

00:05:29.870 --> 00:05:34.010
You have two hours of free time. 
Just don't leave the park.

00:05:34.010 --> 00:05:35.240
Okay!

00:05:35.530 --> 00:05:36.670
Hey, where should we go?

00:05:36.670 --> 00:05:38.660
I think there's a tiger 
over there!

00:05:41.360 --> 00:05:42.670
So flashy!

00:05:44.010 --> 00:05:47.210
Fire the 155 mm barrel 
Ogura Sio Gun!

00:05:44.480 --> 00:05:47.530
<b>155 mm barrell Ogura Sio Gun
Power: Tremendous</b>

00:05:47.740 --> 00:05:48.680
Blam!

00:05:49.080 --> 00:05:50.640
Err, y'know...

00:05:50.720 --> 00:05:52.200
What's she talking about? 
"155 mm"?

00:05:52.200 --> 00:05:53.170
A "Sio gun," I guess.

00:05:53.790 --> 00:05:55.430
I did it again...

00:05:57.840 --> 00:05:59.510
Well, let's go. Coming, Kaoru?

00:06:00.160 --> 00:06:02.500
What if we invited Ogura along?

00:06:03.150 --> 00:06:05.440
Ogura...? Oh!

00:06:06.690 --> 00:06:08.530
'Scuse me, pardon me, sorry!

00:06:07.050 --> 00:06:08.340
<b>Bow bow</b>

00:06:08.860 --> 00:06:10.290
Nah, let's not!

00:06:10.400 --> 00:06:12.630
Ogura seems to like 
being alone, anyhow.

00:06:16.600 --> 00:06:18.480
<b>Da Bing Bao Xiao Bing</b>

00:06:16.990 --> 00:06:20.270
Excuse me! Could I get one of these?

00:06:22.130 --> 00:06:23.980
Oh, uh, Taiwanese... uh...

00:06:23.980 --> 00:06:25.850
Ya sure can! Welcome.

00:06:25.850 --> 00:06:27.990
Huh? What? 
You speak Japanese?

00:06:28.840 --> 00:06:31.660
I learned from a grandfather 
who always liked Japan.

00:06:34.870 --> 00:06:35.780
Here y'are.

00:06:36.100 --> 00:06:38.430
J-Just o-one!

00:06:38.430 --> 00:06:40.190
One, please.

00:06:40.650 --> 00:06:44.880
I told ya I understand 
Japanese. It's a freebie.

00:06:48.980 --> 00:06:50.090
<i>Xiexie!</i>

00:06:50.460 --> 00:06:53.110
Man, I was so nervous.

00:06:55.610 --> 00:06:58.270
Ahh, this is so... good!

00:06:58.710 --> 00:06:59.950
What do you have there?

00:07:01.390 --> 00:07:03.020
A-Asao?

00:07:03.220 --> 00:07:06.690
How can you waste time like this when 
you came all the way to Taiwan?

00:07:06.690 --> 00:07:08.700
W-Well... it's just...

00:07:08.970 --> 00:07:11.290
Ogura, places like this 
aren't fun for you?

00:07:11.770 --> 00:07:15.940
This is my first time in a foreign 
country, so I'm pretty excited!

00:07:17.050 --> 00:07:18.320
Your first time?

00:07:18.320 --> 00:07:19.440
It doesn't show?

00:07:21.300 --> 00:07:23.440
Would you like to see 
some sights together?

00:07:23.780 --> 00:07:26.640
What?! Er... uh... um...

00:07:27.730 --> 00:07:30.720
I guess you could say I'm not cut out 
for going around in a group.

00:07:31.180 --> 00:07:32.150
Well, then...

00:07:32.150 --> 00:07:33.310
Kaoru!

00:07:34.500 --> 00:07:37.490
We heard you can get inside 
that big old dude!

00:07:35.180 --> 00:07:36.720
<b>Big old dude</b>

00:07:37.730 --> 00:07:38.640
Let's go!

00:07:39.080 --> 00:07:40.430
Wait one sec, I'm—

00:07:40.430 --> 00:07:41.680
No, no, it's fine!

00:07:42.580 --> 00:07:46.860
One of the class's most popular girls shouldn't be caught talking to an outcast like me.

00:07:50.590 --> 00:07:51.720
I get it.

00:07:54.940 --> 00:07:55.530
Ha!

00:07:57.410 --> 00:07:58.760
What?!

00:07:58.760 --> 00:08:00.100
Ogura Sio!

00:08:00.890 --> 00:08:03.170
This isn't rocket science.

00:08:04.920 --> 00:08:09.260
How about it? Wanna go with us? 
Into that big old dude?

00:08:10.300 --> 00:08:11.370
Uh...

00:08:13.430 --> 00:08:14.990
I think I'll pass for today.

00:08:16.470 --> 00:08:17.390
But...

00:08:18.530 --> 00:08:19.840
Thanks.

00:08:20.840 --> 00:08:24.870
Okay. We'll call this good 
for today, shall we?

00:08:28.790 --> 00:08:33.350
I'll send it to your phone, so let me know your address once we get to the hotel.

00:08:46.870 --> 00:08:48.800
She's a different species.

00:08:50.040 --> 00:08:52.800
But... I don't hate her.

00:08:59.620 --> 00:09:03.610
Whoa! An F-CK1 from the 
Taiwanese Air Force!

00:09:00.760 --> 00:09:04.220
<b>F-CK1
An indigenous fighter developed
 by the Republic of China. 
Nicknamed Ching-kuo.</b>

00:09:03.610 --> 00:09:05.620
This is crazy!

00:09:10.290 --> 00:09:11.330
It fired...?

00:09:16.970 --> 00:09:18.770
What? What's going on?

00:09:33.350 --> 00:09:35.240
An M60A3...

00:09:38.190 --> 00:09:42.360
...No! A CM-11 "Brave Tiger"!

00:09:39.180 --> 00:09:42.390
<b>CM-11
The domestically produced second-and-a-half 
generation main battle tank developed by Taiwan. 
Nicknamed Brave Tiger.</b>

00:09:51.000 --> 00:09:54.240
Wh— What the crap is that?!

00:10:09.180 --> 00:10:11.430
Wh— What the crap is that?!

00:10:17.010 --> 00:10:20.340
You're not actually gonna shoot 
point-blank, are you?!

00:10:29.910 --> 00:10:32.880
Whoa! It's got a 105 mm rifle!

00:10:59.970 --> 00:11:00.620
A bomb?

00:11:35.390 --> 00:11:36.640
Old man...

00:11:38.450 --> 00:11:40.510
...you gotta run for it. 
Hurry...

00:12:01.670 --> 00:12:03.090
What was that?

00:12:04.990 --> 00:12:09.790
"How about it? Wanna go with us? 
Into that big old dude?"

00:12:15.680 --> 00:12:16.930
Asao!

00:12:18.220 --> 00:12:20.900
The Evolutionary Invasion Object 
has entered Kaohsiung!

00:12:20.900 --> 00:12:23.480
The Taiwan army and air force 
are currently engaged!

00:12:24.300 --> 00:12:25.840
If they've reached the shore...

00:12:26.630 --> 00:12:31.310
...they've evolved to the point 
where they can go on land.

00:12:31.310 --> 00:12:35.610
Contact the governor general of Taiwan's office 
and get them to halt their attack.

00:12:35.610 --> 00:12:40.470
You can't hurt those things with weapons 
made for killing humans.

00:12:40.470 --> 00:12:41.050
Yes, ma'am!

00:12:41.300 --> 00:12:43.030
What's the status of 
the E-gene holders?

00:12:43.030 --> 00:12:46.880
Jack the Ripper of the 2nd Platoon 
is en route in a pod now.

00:12:46.880 --> 00:12:49.460
He'll enter the battle 
zone momentarily.

00:12:49.460 --> 00:12:51.640
Alone? What about backup?

00:12:51.960 --> 00:12:54.260
Gandhi and Newton are still 
preparing to descend.

00:12:55.170 --> 00:12:57.060
It's always the same 
thing with him...

00:12:57.060 --> 00:13:00.190
Perhaps they fear Jack the Ripper,

00:13:00.190 --> 00:13:03.360
just like the unfortunate 
citizens of London did.

00:13:03.360 --> 00:13:04.870
They've seen what he can do.

00:13:05.470 --> 00:13:07.890
Spare me your indiscretions, 
Saint-Germain.

00:13:08.740 --> 00:13:10.440
Forgive me.

00:13:17.710 --> 00:13:21.160
A BGM-109? 
No, something else!

00:13:29.260 --> 00:13:31.740
Got a big one this time, huh?

00:13:35.290 --> 00:13:36.890
That just makes it...

00:13:53.590 --> 00:13:55.140
...easier to aim for!

00:13:58.880 --> 00:14:00.940
What... is that?

00:14:09.370 --> 00:14:11.640
Hmm? Something the matter?

00:14:12.250 --> 00:14:16.580
Not used to moving around on 
land yet, are ya, Lil' Fishie?

00:14:19.780 --> 00:14:21.200
Jack the Ripper!

00:14:21.200 --> 00:14:24.670
Oh, Gandhi, it seems like I won't 
require your protection.

00:14:24.670 --> 00:14:28.820
This thing's huge, but sluggish and 
wide open; I'll be fine on my own.

00:14:28.820 --> 00:14:31.040
This park has plenty of room, 
so I'll take care of it here.

00:14:31.040 --> 00:14:35.430
Hold up on the fighting. It looks like there 
are still quite a few stragglers fleeing.

00:14:38.640 --> 00:14:40.100
Over and out.

00:14:43.620 --> 00:14:45.390
Who... is that guy?

00:14:46.400 --> 00:14:49.290
Did it he... cut it?

00:14:51.370 --> 00:14:52.250
Hold on, you guys!

00:14:53.420 --> 00:14:56.060
Asao was with you, wasn't she? 
What happened?

00:14:56.920 --> 00:15:00.780
I... I dunno. There was just 
this sudden explosion...

00:15:01.210 --> 00:15:03.810
We called her phone, but she didn't pick up. 
She must've already run away.

00:15:04.200 --> 00:15:07.190
What?! She couldn't have! 
It's a straight shot!

00:15:11.630 --> 00:15:13.570
So, she must still be...

00:15:27.100 --> 00:15:29.160
Over here, ya big freak.

00:15:30.600 --> 00:15:31.660
Later!

00:15:48.860 --> 00:15:52.440
Uh, Gandhi. I take back 
what I said earlier.

00:15:52.440 --> 00:15:54.960
You better get here 
as soon as you can.

00:15:54.960 --> 00:15:56.000
What's going on?

00:15:56.880 --> 00:15:59.970
It seems this big one was just...

00:16:00.650 --> 00:16:03.280
...a landing ship.

00:16:10.090 --> 00:16:13.100
If I kill five at a time...

00:16:13.100 --> 00:16:16.950
Hmm... How many times 
do I have to swing?

00:16:18.960 --> 00:16:22.160
Asao! Asao!

00:16:29.450 --> 00:16:30.520
Asao!

00:16:35.720 --> 00:16:36.900
You're alive!

00:16:50.060 --> 00:16:54.160
What the? Civilians shouldn't be hangin' 
around here. Got a death wish?

00:16:54.560 --> 00:16:57.600
W-W-What about Asao?

00:16:59.520 --> 00:17:03.680
Ah. Well, get on with it, then. 
Save her and get outta here.

00:17:03.680 --> 00:17:05.100
You're in the way—

00:17:17.070 --> 00:17:20.320
Wait your turn, dammit!

00:17:24.210 --> 00:17:27.480
All right, how many are left?

00:17:32.660 --> 00:17:36.310
Not good. 
I've lost too much blood.

00:17:37.980 --> 00:17:40.670
I can't keep... my form...

00:17:44.580 --> 00:17:46.940
We've lost Jack the Ripper's 
E-gene signal.

00:17:47.220 --> 00:17:49.150
Ball #13 has gone quiet.

00:17:57.810 --> 00:17:59.790
U-Umm...

00:18:13.350 --> 00:18:15.340
This ball...

00:18:20.660 --> 00:18:24.680
What is it? I feel like I've seen it 
before... forever ago...

00:18:27.800 --> 00:18:28.660
Asao!

00:18:35.290 --> 00:18:36.460
Don't go!

00:18:40.080 --> 00:18:42.580
If a mere human goes, 
it's only to their death.

00:18:43.790 --> 00:18:44.800
But...

00:18:46.960 --> 00:18:47.940
...I haven't...

00:18:50.470 --> 00:18:53.260
...given her my... 
email address yet!

00:18:56.860 --> 00:19:00.710
Ball #13 is seeing an influx of energy! 
It's a forced reboot!

00:19:01.320 --> 00:19:03.280
Jack the Ripper is back up?

00:19:03.670 --> 00:19:05.870
No. It's...

00:19:06.450 --> 00:19:08.030
...an unregistered E-gene signal.

00:19:08.840 --> 00:19:12.660
You mean there was an unknown 
holder? Down there?

00:19:14.100 --> 00:19:15.560
Now analyzing for gene year.

00:19:16.870 --> 00:19:19.620
Here it is: 1582 A.D.

00:19:22.360 --> 00:19:26.610
Ball #13 energy flow 
is at 90... 95...

00:19:26.610 --> 00:19:29.400
100... 105... 110!

00:19:29.700 --> 00:19:31.200
It's still rising!

00:19:33.280 --> 00:19:35.800
Are you kidding me? 
She's a...?!

00:19:38.350 --> 00:19:39.430
I...

00:19:41.060 --> 00:19:42.260
...remember!

00:19:52.300 --> 00:19:56.260
Verily, I have taken your 
double helix of life.

00:19:57.210 --> 00:20:02.250
I will now create the one who will rightly 
be called your reincarnation,

00:20:02.250 --> 00:20:03.350
in a future generation.

00:20:05.660 --> 00:20:08.840
These spheres respond 
only to reincarnations,

00:20:08.840 --> 00:20:12.760
and form the core of whatever 
weapon they wish for.

00:20:13.750 --> 00:20:18.530
It is the only power that can protect this 
planet from the Invasion Objects.

00:20:21.460 --> 00:20:25.860
I wonder what weapon your 
reincarnation will wish for.

00:20:26.740 --> 00:20:29.350
Heh. That's obvious!

00:20:47.550 --> 00:20:49.030
A gun!

00:20:50.370 --> 00:20:52.860
So it's you, Nobunaga!

00:20:57.600 --> 00:21:00.180
Who are you?

00:21:02.000 --> 00:21:03.300
Nobunagun!

00:21:03.910 --> 00:21:06.020
Huh? Nobuna<i>gun</i>?

00:21:12.960 --> 00:21:16.080
To you, who have 
inherited my soul!

00:21:16.380 --> 00:21:18.600
If the time has come,

00:21:19.790 --> 00:21:22.580
wreak havoc unto your 
heart's content!

00:23:07.140 --> 00:23:11.040
Gandhi to H.Q. I'll be touching down 
in Kaohsiung in 60 seconds.

00:23:11.580 --> 00:23:14.830
Upon entering the battle zone, 
I'll begin supporting Jack.

00:23:15.150 --> 00:23:18.580
The E-gene holder currently engaged 
is not Jack the Ripper,

00:23:18.970 --> 00:23:21.210
but codename "Nobunagun."

00:23:21.800 --> 00:23:24.750
Sounds like there's a 
new holder, Newton.

00:23:25.430 --> 00:23:27.250
Hope it's a cute girl.

00:23:27.500 --> 00:23:32.110
Gandhi, if you keep up this bullshit chatter 
before battle, I'll stomp you dead.

00:23:33.500 --> 00:23:35.100
Ever the stickler, huh, Newton?
